"Tieroo is an external service. To open the account, Odoo sends it this "
"company's name, VAT number, address and your email. After that, to issue and"
" update the cards, it sends each card holder's name, barcode, points, next "
"reward, level and language. Emails with the cards are sent by Odoo itself."
